            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Hoi An Xinh Xich",
            "review_text": "little dingdong\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia11 contributions\n0\nNormal\nFeb 2020\nTaste very normal (at least for me & 2 girl friends). \n\nWe ordered 2 banh mi favour of pork belly VND35K and vegetarian VND30K, share by 3 of us. Bit spicy for us (our spicy level consider medium).\n\nCoffee normal as well. \n\nLocate near to Nha Trang cathedral, just 5mins walking distance. Follow google map, keep an eye out, it locate at small alley.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
