            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Hoi An Xinh Xich",
            "review_text": "Jenny L\nHong Kong, China153 contributions\n0\nNice Banh Mi\nNov 2018 • Family\nThis cafe is just right next to the Cathedral! \nBut it’s pretty hard to find because it’s in a small alley. Not like what’s shown in the map. \n\nWe ordered a sweet coffee, a coconut coffee, a mango juice, and two Banh Mi! \n\nThe sweet coffee was pretty sweet but has a strong coffee taste.\n\nThe coconut juice looked very nice! But the coconut scent wasn’t that strong. \n\nMango smoothie was nice. Not so sweet. \n\nThe two Banh mi we ordered were with Vietnamese pork and one with sausage, ham and egg. \n\nThe baguette was really crispy! They have chilli sauce on it~ just right for some light snack!\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2018",
